        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And some of the Hebrews went over Jordan to the land of Gad and Gilead. As for Saul, he was yet in Gilgal, and all the people followed him trembling.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 23,
            "text": "1 Sam. 14:21."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
