        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "And Samuel arose, and gat him up from Gilgal unto Gibeah of Benjamin. And Saul numbered the people that were present with him, about six hundred men.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 99,
            "end": 108
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 13:15",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "And Saul, and Jonathan his son, and the people that were present with them, abode in Gibeah of Benjamin: but the Philistines encamped in Michmash.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 56
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 13:16",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "And the spoilers came out of the camp of the Philistines in three companies: one company turned unto the way that leadeth to Ophrah, unto the land of Shual:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 109,
            "end": 124
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 13:17",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "And another company turned the way to Beth-horon: and another company turned to the way of the border that looketh to the valley of Zeboim toward the wilderness.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 37
          },
          {
            "start": 77,
            "end": 79
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "1 Samuel 13:18",
        "book": "1 Samuel",
        "chapter": 13,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "Now there was no smith found throughout all the land of Israel: for the Philistines said, Lest the Hebrews make them swords or spears:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 17,
            "end": 22,
            "text": "2 Kgs. 24:14."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
